id: pm-f7jj9b
title: "GH-860: pm-beads --preserve-source-ids changes source ID casing"
description: "The pm-beads preserve-source-ids path changes the casing of imported Beads IDs, breaking exact identity preservation and downstream references. Preserve the authoritative source spelling byte-for-byte while retaining collision and filesystem safety."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:extensions",identity,migration,pm-beads,source-preservation
created_at: "2026-08-02T14:11:08.877Z"
