  "2026-08-02T14:11:08.877Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: exact GH-860 and all-status preserve-source-ids casing searches found no canonical owner. Historical ID preservation and importer items are closed and do not cover source spelling parity."
  "2026-08-26T18:50:50.476Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: mixed-case preserve-source-ids still lowercases through normalizeRawItemId and case-only collisions are skipped after partial writes instead of failing closed; focused package tests failed before implementation."
  "2026-08-26T20:48:43.518Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: manual installed-package import preserved Tokenwerk-A1, Tokenwerk-B2, and Tokenwerk-C3 byte-for-byte in source casing; dependency Tokenwerk-A1 -> Tokenwerk-B2 retained exact casing and hash-shorthand lookup is covered. Full suite 8,020/8,020 and exact coverage 100/100/100/100 passed."
  "2026-08-26T20:58:07.175Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence: post-closeout defect-evidence correctly failed closed until this production defect had structured prevention evidence. Bound closure to the beads-source-identity-preservation gate, case-only source/target collision negative controls, exact-case readback, focused Beads/store tests, exact coverage, and hosted static/coverage checks. No waiver is used."
  "2026-08-27T01:33:30.958Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence from exact-head CodeRabbit round: locateItem accepted empty, whitespace-only, and hash-only identifiers after prefix normalization and located a real pm-.toon record; the new negative control failed on the prefix-only item."
  "2026-08-27T02:27:11.690Z","harness:codex","Evidence: Item lookup rejects empty, whitespace-only, and prefix-only raw identifiers before filesystem resolution, with a prefix-only item negative control. Linked plans passed 76/76 and 34/34; full repository gate passed exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-27T04:57:58.155Z","harness:codex","Review TDD intake: CodeRabbit exact-head review 5037361338 identified an unrelated empty-identifier close reason on the GH-860 case-preservation issue."
  "2026-08-27T05:00:31.795Z","harness:codex","Live tracker verification confirms GH-860 currently carries an unrelated empty/prefix-only lookup close_reason despite casing/collision title, acceptance, and actual_result; correction will be recorded through pm close history."
